{# =====================================================================
   §5  STRESS SELLOFF FILTER  (engine/dislocation.py)

   TIER-3 HOME, operator ruling 2026-07-30. This readout used to render as a
   standalone container on macro.html — the primary board — where the operator
   read it as "all machine language … nothing they can remotely understand":
   an eyebrow reading DISLOCATION, a verdict slug ("Buyable washout"), an
   internal switch name ("Fed-put switch"), a K-of-N count ("only 1 of 4 stress
   triggers"), a study ID ("Gate-2 entry timer") and five bare percentile /
   threshold pairs, every one of them banned from the glance tier by
   docs/DESIGN_DOCTRINE.md Law 2. It is now demoted here, whole.

   This is the same move the Risk Radar card made (dashboard.html.j2, "full
   per-scare detail + self-audit are on the Macro Signals data page") and the
   same cross-page link idiom the Fear/Greed panel already uses
   (macro_signals.html#fear-greed-detail). macro.html keeps the ANNOUNCEMENT —
   the alerts-pane entry and the "What To Do Now" row — rewritten in plain
   words; both link here for the receipts.

   PRESENTATION ONLY — every claim below is the calibrated engine copy,
   re-housed. Nothing is reworded, softened, or dropped. The panel header
   follows Tier-1 rules (doctrine §1: "their top-of-page header still follows
   Tier 1 rules"); everything under it is Tier 3 and may be as technical as the
   engine is.
   ===================================================================== #}
{% if latest and latest.dislocation %}
{% set DL = latest.dislocation %}
{% set DI = DL.inputs %}
{% set vcolor = 'var(--up)' if DL.verdict=='buyable_washout' else ('var(--down)' if DL.verdict=='stand_aside' else 'var(--muted)') %}
{# THE FED-PUT SWITCH IS TRI-STATE, not a boolean (engine/dislocation.py DEGRADE
   CONTRACT, 2026-07-29). A missing or stale Sahm / breakeven leg used to read as
   "leg not firing" -> put present -> buyable washout: a data outage failed OPEN
   toward the permissive verdict. The engine now degrades `put_state` to "unknown"
   with `put_state_reliable: false` and a `stale_inputs` list. Rendering that third
   state through `DL.fed_put` alone would print "backstop gone" for "we cannot read
   the switch" — the opposite reading. Older payloads carry NEITHER key, so the
   tri-state falls back to the boolean and this whole branch stays dark. #}
{% set _put_unknown = ((DL.put_state is defined and DL.put_state == 'unknown')
                       or (DL.put_state_reliable is defined and not DL.put_state_reliable)
                       or (DL.fed_put is defined and DL.fed_put is none)) %}
{% set _put_stale = DL.stale_inputs if (DL.stale_inputs is defined and DL.stale_inputs) else [] %}
{% set dlp = 'var(--muted)' if _put_unknown else ('var(--up)' if DL.fed_put else 'var(--down)') %}
{# Stress triggers come from the ENGINE's authoritative list (DI.triggers), never
   re-derived here. The template used to re-test the thresholds in Jinja, and
   `DI.vrp_pctile > 0.9` is False against a value the engine already ROUNDED to 2dp
   (0.9027 -> 0.9) — so on a live variance-premium-only dislocation the page printed
   "Stress triggers firing" above an EMPTY chip row. Loosening the comparison would
   have moved the gate; reading the engine's list cannot. #}
{% set _trigs = DI.triggers or [] %}
{% set _TRIG_ZH = {'VIX panic': 'VIX 恐慌', 'drawdown': '回撤',
                   'VRP extreme': '方差溢价极端', 'VIX backwardation': 'VIX 倒挂'} %}
{# EN display names for engine slugs that read as acronym soup at a glance. #}
{% set _TRIG_EN = {'VRP extreme': 'variance-premium extreme'} %}
{% set _tgj = _trigs | join('|') %}
{% set _cap_extra = [] %}
{% for _s in (DI.capitulation_signals or []) %}{% if _s not in _trigs %}{% set _ = _cap_extra.append(_s) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{# Trigger limits mirror engine/dislocation.py DEFAULTS — vix_panic 30.0,
   dip_pct 0.10, vrp_pctile_extreme 0.90, backwardation_ratio 1.0, sahm_trigger
   0.50, fedput_breakeven 2.5. Display-only copies (the payload carries readings,
   not limits); grep this comment if those constants ever move. #}
<div class="panel span12 rail-mood anim-d5 dislo-panel" id="dislocation" style="--lit:{{ vcolor }};--dlp:{{ dlp }}">
  {# HEADER — Tier-1 rules apply here: plain words, a stance, no slugs. #}
  <h2>{{ t('Stress selloff filter', '压力抛售过滤器') }}
    {{ help("A risk FILTER that sits in FRONT of the capitulation gauge: when a stress dislocation hits (VIX panic, a >10% drawdown, a variance-premium extreme or VIX backwardation), it asks ONE question — is the Fed put present? PUT-ABSENT = a recession is underway (real-time Sahm >= 0.50) OR inflation locks the Fed (sustained 10y breakeven >= 2.5%). What the replay actually shows: it REFUSED the 2008 crash (put-absent from 2008-04), but it printed buyable early in the 2000-02 bear and twice in 2022 with the breakeven within 0.02pp of the cutoff. So this is a drawdown filter with known misses, not a knife-proof shield, and not a bounce-catcher — measured on SPY 1997-2026, see research/DISLOCATION_VALIDATION.md.", "位于恐慌触底指标之前的风险过滤器：当压力错位出现（VIX 恐慌、>10% 回撤、方差溢价极端或 VIX 倒挂）时，它只问一个问题 — 美联储托底是否在位？托底缺失＝衰退进行中（实时 Sahm ≥ 0.50）或通胀锁住美联储（持续十年期盈亏平衡 ≥ 2.5%）。回放实际显示：它拒绝了 2008 年的崩盘（自 2008-04 起判定托底缺失），但在 2000-02 熊市早期给出过「可买入」，2022 年内亦有两次，且这两次盈亏平衡率距阈值均在 0.02 个百分点以内。因此这是一个存在已知漏判的回撤过滤器，既非防飞刀的护盾，也不是抄反弹的工具 — 基于标普 1997-2026 实测。") }}
  </h2>
  <p class="dlx-sub">{{ t('One question, asked when selling turns stressed: would the Fed still step in? It filters how deep the damage usually gets — it never says buy.', '当抛售转为压力状态时只问一个问题：美联储是否仍会出手？它过滤的是「通常会跌多深」，而非买入时机。') }}</p>

  {% if not DL.dislocation_active %}
  {# DORMANT — stated plainly instead of the section vanishing. A data page that
     silently omits a quiet filter teaches the reader nothing about what quiet
     looks like, and it is exactly why this readout felt like it "suddenly popped
     up" when it fired. #}
  <p class="dlx-dormant"><b>{{ t('Quiet right now.', '当前休眠。') }}</b>
    {{ t('Markets are not in a stress selloff, so this filter is asleep. It wakes only when one of four stress readings crosses its line — and you will see it on the macro board when it does.', '市场未处于压力抛售，该过滤器处于休眠。仅当四项压力读数之一越线时才会启动 — 届时宏观看板会提示。') }}</p>
  {% else %}

  {# STANCE — the one plain-word line that answers "so what do I do". #}
  <p class="dlx-stance">
    {% if DL.verdict=='buyable_washout' %}<b>{{ t('Watch — don’t chase.', '观察 — 不要追。') }}</b> {{ t('The selling is stressed but the Fed’s backstop still reads intact. Wait for the market to steady; do not try to catch it.', '抛售处于压力状态，但美联储托底仍在位。等待市场企稳，勿提前抢跑。') }}
    {% elif DL.verdict=='stand_aside' %}<b>{{ t('Stand aside.', '观望。') }}</b> {{ t('This is the put-absent setup the gate refused from April 2008, where the same capitulation signals kept firing into the fall.', '这是一道闸自 2008 年 4 月起持续拒绝的「托底缺失」情形，同样的恐慌信号在下跌途中不断触发。') }}
    {% elif _put_unknown %}<b>{{ t('Watch — don’t chase.', '观察 — 不要追。') }}</b> {{ t('No buyable or stand-aside call is made while the switch cannot be read: a missing reading is not a reading that says all-clear.', '在开关无法判读期间不作「可买入」或「观望」的判定：读不到，不等于读到了安全。') }}
    {% else %}<b>{{ t('Watch — don’t chase.', '观察 — 不要追。') }}</b> {{ t('An acute stress dislocation is firing.', '急性压力错位正在触发。') }}{% endif %}
    <span class="dlx-hon">{{ t('A risk filter, not a buy signal.', '这是风险过滤器而非买入信号。') }}</span>
  </p>
  {% if DL.capitulation_caveat %}
  <p class="dlx-warn">⚠ {{ t('The capitulation gauge is firing, but the Fed put is absent — its measured bounce does NOT apply here (the falling-knife regime).', '恐慌触底指标在触发，但美联储托底缺失 — 其实测反弹在此不适用（接飞刀情形）。') }}</p>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="dlx-rows">

    {# What is firing, and by how much. The margin line prints all four stress
       readings against their own limits — firing or not — so a one-trigger state
       reads as a one-trigger state instead of as a broad washout. #}
    <div class="dlx-row">
      <span class="dlx-lbl">{{ t('Stress triggers', '压力信号') }}</span>
      <span class="dlx-val"><span class="dlx-chips">
          {%- for tg in _trigs %}
          {%- set _stem = 'VIX panic' if tg.startswith('VIX panic') else ('drawdown' if tg.startswith('drawdown') else tg) %}
          {%- set _tail = tg | replace(_stem, '') %}
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;color:{{ vcolor }}">{{ t(_TRIG_EN.get(tg, tg), _TRIG_ZH.get(_stem, _stem) ~ _tail) }}</span>
          {%- endfor %}
          {%- if not _trigs %}<span class="muted">{{ t('none firing', '无触发') }}</span>{% endif %}
        </span>
        {%- if DI.capitulation_active %}<span class="dlx-cap">{% if _cap_extra %}— {{ t('capitulation gauge also firing on ', '恐慌触底指标同时触发：') }}{% for s in _cap_extra %}{{ t(_TRIG_EN.get(s, s), _TRIG_ZH.get(s, s)) }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if DI.capitulation_strong %} ⚑{% endif %}{% else %}— {{ t('capitulation gauge firing on the same reading, not a second signal', '恐慌触底指标基于同一读数触发，并非第二个信号') }}{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}
        {# MARGIN LINE — every stress reading against its own limit, firing or not.
           The variance-premium reading prints its TRUE margin: the engine emits
           `vrp_pctile_raw` at 4dp precisely because the 2dp display copy (0.9027 ->
           0.9) made a firing trigger read as a tie against its own 90 limit. With
           the raw value present the "rounded for display" hedge is retired; on an
           older payload that lacks it the 2dp reading + the hedge are kept, because
           then the tie really is a rounding artefact we cannot resolve here. #}
        {% set _vrp_raw = DI.vrp_pctile_raw if (DI.vrp_pctile_raw is defined and DI.vrp_pctile_raw is not none) else none %}
        <span class="dlx-margins">
          {%- if _vrp_raw is not none %}<span class="dlx-mg{{ ' on' if 'VRP extreme' in _trigs }}">{{ t('variance premium', '方差溢价') }} {{ '%.1f'|format(_vrp_raw * 100) }}{{ t('th pct vs 90th', ' 百分位 对 90 百分位') }}</span> · {% elif DI.vrp_pctile is not none %}<span class="dlx-mg{{ ' on' if 'VRP extreme' in _trigs }}">{{ t('variance premium', '方差溢价') }} {{ '%.0f'|format(DI.vrp_pctile * 100) }}{{ t('th pct vs 90', ' 百分位 对 90') }}</span> · {% endif %}
          {%- if DI.vix is not none %}<span class="dlx-mg{{ ' on' if 'VIX panic' in _tgj }}">{{ t('VIX', 'VIX') }} {{ DI.vix }} {{ t('vs 30', '对 30') }}</span> · {% endif %}
          {%- if DI.spy_drawdown_pct is not none %}<span class="dlx-mg{{ ' on' if 'drawdown' in _tgj }}">{{ t('drawdown', '回撤') }} {{ DI.spy_drawdown_pct }}% {{ t('vs -10%', '对 -10%') }}</span> · {% endif %}
          {%- if DI.vix_term is not none %}<span class="dlx-mg{{ ' on' if 'VIX backwardation' in _trigs }}">{{ t('VIX term', 'VIX 期限') }} {{ '%.2f'|format(DI.vix_term) }} {{ t('vs 1.00', '对 1.00') }}</span>{% endif %}
          {%- if _vrp_raw is none %} · {{ t('readings rounded for display; the gate uses full precision', '读数为展示用四舍五入；闸门使用完整精度') }}{% endif %}
        </span>
      </span>
    </div>

    {# The master switch, with both of its sub-readings against their own limits —
       this is the discriminator the whole verdict turns on, so it stays visible. #}
    <div class="dlx-row">
      <span class="dlx-lbl">{{ t('Fed-put switch', '美联储托底开关') }}
        {{ help("The one out-of-sample-stable discriminator (holds in BOTH 1997-2011 and 2012-2025). PUT-ABSENT = recession underway (Sahm >= 0.50) OR inflation locks the Fed (sustained 10y breakeven >= 2.5%). Primary trend is shown as context but adds little on top of the switch.", "唯一在样本外稳定的判别器（1997-2011 与 2012-2025 两半区均成立）。托底缺失＝衰退进行中（Sahm ≥ 0.50）或通胀锁住美联储（持续十年期盈亏平衡 ≥ 2.5%）。主趋势作为背景显示，但在开关之上增益有限。") }}
      </span>
      {# Which legs the engine could not read (stable keys, so the ZH lane can name
         them in Chinese instead of echoing the engine's English receipt). #}
      {% set _stale_j = _put_stale | join(' ') %}
      <span class="dlx-val"><b style="color:{{ dlp }}">{% if _put_unknown %}{{ t('Switch unreadable', '开关无法判读') }}{% elif DL.fed_put %}{{ t('Put present', '托底在位') }}{% else %}{{ t('Put ABSENT', '托底缺失') }}{% endif %}</b>
        {%- if _put_unknown %}<span class="dlx-dis"> · ⚠ {{ t('inputs stale or missing — no ruling', '输入过期或缺失 — 不作判定') }}</span>
        {%- elif not DL.fed_put %}<span style="color:var(--down)">
        {%- if DI.sahm is not none and DI.sahm >= 0.5 %} · ⚑ {{ t('recession underway (Sahm)', '衰退进行中（Sahm）') }}{% endif %}
        {%- if DI.breakeven_10y_1m is not none and DI.breakeven_10y_1m >= 2.5 %} · ⚑ {{ t('inflation locks the Fed', '通胀锁住美联储') }}{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}
        {%- if _put_unknown %}
        <span class="dlx-margins dlx-dis">{{ t('Cannot read:', '无法读取：') }}
          {%- if 'sahm' in _stale_j %} {{ t('the real-time recession trigger', '实时衰退触发指标') }}{% endif %}
          {%- if 'sahm' in _stale_j and 'breakeven' in _stale_j %} ·{% endif %}
          {%- if 'breakeven' in _stale_j %} {{ t('the 10-year breakeven', '十年期盈亏平衡通胀率') }}{% endif %}
          {%- if not _put_stale %} {{ t('one of the two switch legs', '开关两条腿中的一条') }}{% endif %}
          {{ help(('Engine staleness receipt — ' ~ (_put_stale | join('; '))) if _put_stale else 'The Fed-put switch reported itself unreadable; no per-leg receipt was published with this reading.', '引擎过期回执（英文原文见英文版）：该腿的最后印刷日期已超出其过期预算，因此引擎拒绝以「未触发」来解读一个读不到的读数。') }}</span>
        {%- endif %}
        {# VINTAGES (a monthly reference month is not a same-day read). Sahm is a
           monthly reference-month series with a ~6-week publication lag, carried
           forward by ffill, so its own stamp is materially older than the row it sits
           on — that is true of the construction whether or not the engine has shipped
           `sahm_asof` yet, so the nature is stated always and the date is added when
           the payload carries it. #}
        <span class="dlx-margins">Sahm <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(DI.sahm) if DI.sahm is not none else '—' }}</b> {{ t('vs 0.50', '对 0.50') }}
          <span class="dlx-vint">({{ t('monthly reference month, carried forward', '月度参考月数据，向前沿用') }}{% if DI.sahm_asof is defined and DI.sahm_asof %} · {{ DI.sahm_asof }}{% endif %})</span>
          · {{ t('10y breakeven', '十年盈亏平衡') }} <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(DI.breakeven_10y_1m) if DI.breakeven_10y_1m is not none else '—' }}%</b> {{ t('vs 2.50%', '对 2.50%') }}
          <span class="dlx-vint">({{ t('21-day average', '21 日均值') }}{% if DI.breakeven_asof is defined and DI.breakeven_asof %} · {{ DI.breakeven_asof }}{% endif %})</span>
          · {{ t('trend', '趋势') }} <b>{{ t('up', '上行') if DI.primary_trend=='up' else t('down', '下行') }}</b></span>
      </span>
    </div>

    {% if DL.gate2 and DL.gate2.state not in ('dormant', 'unknown') %}
    {% set g2 = DL.gate2 %}
    {% set g2color = 'var(--up)' if g2.state=='confirmed' else ('var(--warn)' if g2.state=='awaiting_confirm' else 'var(--muted)') %}
    <div class="dlx-row">
      <span class="dlx-lbl">{{ t('Entry timer', '入场时机') }}
        {{ help("The entry TIMER — it arms ONLY once Gate-1 says buyable, and it is a coincident CONFIRM, never anticipation: it waits for the VIX term structure to un-invert (backwardation back to contango), which historically lags the VIX peak by ~13 sessions. MEASURED on matched buyable washouts (2006+): waiting for the un-inversion lifted hit-rate 61->67%, median 3-month return +2.2->+4.6% and shallowed median drawdown -4.5->-2.9% — but the 1-in-10 tail was marginally worse. A confirm, not a bottom-caller.", "入场时机器 — 仅在一道闸判定可买入后才启动，且是同步确认而非提前预判：它等待 VIX 期限结构回正（由倒挂转为正向），历史上滞后 VIX 峰值约 13 个交易日。基于匹配的可买入错杀样本（2006+）实测：等待回正将胜率由 61% 提升至 67%，三月中位回报 +2.2% 升至 +4.6%，中位回撤由 −4.5% 收窄至 −2.9% — 但 1/10 尾部略差。这是确认，而非抄底。") }}
      </span>
      {# TERM-STRUCTURE DISTANCE — how far the timer is from arming, so the state's
         flip is visible before it happens. Prefer the engine's own
         `distance_to_backwardation`; on an older payload derive it from the same two
         display numbers already printed in the trigger-margin line above (the 1.00
         limit is the display copy of backwardation_ratio noted at the top of this
         panel). Presentation subtraction only — it decides nothing. #}
      {% set _g2d = g2.distance_to_backwardation if (g2.distance_to_backwardation is defined and g2.distance_to_backwardation is not none)
                    else ((1.0 - DI.vix_term) if DI.vix_term is not none else none) %}
      <span class="dlx-val"><b style="color:{{ g2color }}">
        {%- if g2.state=='confirmed' %}{{ t('Re-entry confirmed', '入场已确认') }}
        {%- elif g2.state=='awaiting_confirm' %}{{ t('Awaiting confirm', '等待确认') }}
        {%- else %}{{ t('No timer signal', '无时机信号') }}{% endif %}</b><span class="muted"> —
        {%- if g2.state=='confirmed' %} {{ t('term structure un-inverted', '期限结构已回正') }}{% if g2.hook_days_ago is not none %} ({{ g2.hook_days_ago }} {{ t('sessions ago', '个交易日前') }}){% endif %}{{ t('; the mean-reversion confirm — wait for it, do not anticipate.', '；均值回归确认 — 等待它，勿提前抢跑。') }}
        {%- elif g2.state=='awaiting_confirm' %} {{ t('term structure still backwardated; wait for the un-inversion (historically ~13 sessions after the VIX peak), do not anticipate.', '期限结构仍倒挂；等待回正（历史上约在 VIX 峰值后 13 个交易日），勿提前抢跑。') }}
        {%- else %} {{ t('no measured entry timer applies to this trigger.', '此触发条件下没有实测的入场时机器。') }}{% endif %}</span>
        {# The no_signal branch used to hardcode "rely on Gate-1" — which converted the
           ABSENCE of a measured timer into an implied entry. The engine rewrote its own
           copy, so render the engine's string (label / label_zh) and it can never drift
           from the gate again. Older payloads ship the retired sentence and carry no
           label_zh, so the corrected wording is mirrored here for them; the ZH twin is
           the tell that a payload has the new copy. #}
        <span class="dlx-margins">
          {%- if g2.state=='no_signal' %}{% if g2.label_zh is defined and g2.label_zh %}<span class="l-en">{{ g2.label }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ g2.label_zh }}</span>{% else %}{{ t('The confirm study covers VIX-backwardation episodes only, so there is no measured timer for this trigger. Do NOT treat Gate-1 alone as an entry signal: Gate-1 is a risk filter that says which washouts are refusable, never when to enter.', '确认研究仅覆盖 VIX 倒挂情形，因此此触发条件下没有实测的时机器。切勿将一道闸单独视为入场信号：一道闸是判断哪些错杀应当回避的风险过滤器，而非入场时点。') }}{% endif %}
          {%- endif %}
          {%- if DI.vix_term is not none %}{% if g2.state=='no_signal' %}<br>{% endif %}{{ t('VIX term', 'VIX 期限') }} <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(DI.vix_term) }}</b> {{ t('vs 1.00', '对 1.00') }}{% if _g2d is not none and _g2d > 0 %} — <span class="l-en">still <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(_g2d) }}</b> from the level that arms this timer</span><span class="l-zh">距启动该时机器还差 <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(_g2d) }}</b></span>{% endif %}{% endif %}
        </span>
      </span>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if DL.catalyst_narrative %}
    {% set CN = DL.catalyst_narrative %}
    <div class="dlx-row">
      <span class="dlx-lbl">{{ t('Catalyst cross-check', '催化交叉验证') }}
        {{ help("An AI read of the actual catalyst TEXT (engine/catalyst_tone.py, DeepSeek) cross-checked against the Fed-put switch: does the document read as a reversible washout or a structural break? CONTEXT ONLY — it never changes the verdict; the validated gate governs. Shown only on an active dislocation when the read is confidence-passed and quote-verified.", "对实际催化文本的 AI 解读（engine/catalyst_tone.py，DeepSeek）与美联储托底开关的交叉验证：文档解读为可逆抛售还是结构性断裂？仅供背景 —— 绝不改变判定，以经验证的一道闸为准。仅在活跃错位且解读通过置信度与引文核验时显示。") }}
      </span>
      <span class="dlx-val"><span class="{{ 'dlx-dis' if CN.agreement != 'corroborates' }}">{% if CN.agreement != 'corroborates' %}⚠ {% endif %}{% if CN.agreement=='corroborates' %}{{ t('corroborates', '印证') }}{% else %}{{ t('diverges', '背离') }}{% endif %}</span>
        · {{ t('catalyst reads', '催化解读') }} <b><span class="l-en">{{ CN.shock_reversible }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ CN.shock_reversible_zh or CN.shock_reversible }}</span></b>
        <span class="dlx-margins"><span class="l-en">{{ CN.note }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ CN.note_zh or CN.note }}</span></span>
      </span>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if DL.geo_reversibility %}
    {% set GR = DL.geo_reversibility %}
    <div class="dlx-row">
      <span class="dlx-lbl">{{ t('Geopolitical read', '地缘解读') }}
        {{ help("A DETERMINISTIC reversibility cross-check from the GPR threat/act split (Caldara-Iacoviello, AER 2022): the THREAT component of geopolitical risk historically reverts (~3 months) while realized ACTS persist. The free, always-available complement to the AI catalyst cross-check above — shown only on an active dislocation when geopolitical risk is elevated (≥80th pct) and the threat/act mix has a clear lean. CONTEXT ONLY — it never changes the verdict; the validated Fed-put gate governs.", "基于 GPR 威胁／行动分量的确定性可逆性交叉验证（Caldara-Iacoviello，AER 2022）：地缘风险的「威胁」分量历史上往往回落（约3个月），而已发生的「行动」更持久。这是上方 AI 催化交叉验证的免费、始终可用的补充 —— 仅在活跃错位、地缘风险偏高（≥80百分位）且威胁／行动结构有明确倾向时显示。仅供背景 —— 绝不改变判定，以经验证的美联储托底闸为准。") }}
      </span>
      <span class="dlx-val"><span class="{{ 'dlx-dis' if GR.agreement != 'corroborates' }}">{% if GR.agreement != 'corroborates' %}⚠ {% endif %}{% if GR.agreement=='corroborates' %}{{ t('corroborates', '印证') }}{% else %}{{ t('diverges', '背离') }}{% endif %}</span>
        · {{ t('reads', '解读为') }} <b><span class="l-en">{{ GR.reversibility }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ GR.reversibility_zh or GR.reversibility }}</span></b>
        ({{ t('led by', '主导') }} {{ t('threats', '威胁') if GR.lean=='threat' else t('acts', '行动') }}{% if GR.gpr_pct is not none %}, {{ GR.gpr_pct }}{{ t('th pct', '百分位') }}{% endif %})
        <span class="dlx-margins"><span class="l-en">{{ GR.note }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ GR.note_zh or GR.note }}</span></span>
      </span>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

  </div>{# /dlx-rows #}

  <details class="dlx-more">
    <summary>{{ t('How the gate reads it, and the measured record', '闸门如何判读及实测记录') }}</summary>
    <div class="dlx-mbody">
      {# WHAT THE LEG ACTUALLY TESTED. The old paragraph said "inflation not blocking
         easing" — a POLICY conclusion drawn from an INFLATION test. The leg compares
         the 21-day 10y breakeven with a 2.5% cutoff and checks that no recession
         trigger fires; it never observes what the Fed will do, and `fed_stance` can
         read hawkish on the very same artifact (which is why the engine now attaches
         `policy_divergence`). Cutoff below is the display copy of fedput_breakeven
         noted at the top of this panel. #}
      <p class="dlx-para">
        {% if DL.verdict=='buyable_washout' %}{{ t('A stress dislocation with the Fed put intact — no recession trigger firing, and the 21-day 10-year breakeven', '压力错位且美联储托底在位 — 衰退触发条件未激活，且 21 日十年期盈亏平衡通胀率') }}
          {%- if DI.breakeven_10y_1m is not none %} {{ t('is', '为') }} <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(DI.breakeven_10y_1m) }}%</b>{{ t(', under its 2.50% cutoff', '，低于 2.50% 阈值') }}{% else %} {{ t('is under its 2.50% cutoff', '低于 2.50% 阈值') }}{% endif %}.
          {{ t('That is a market-priced inflation reading, not a reading of what the Fed will do. Historically these mean-revert with shallower median drawdown — confirm into stabilization, do not anticipate.', '这是市场定价的通胀读数，而非对美联储行动的判断。历史上此类情形回归均值且中位回撤更浅 — 在企稳中确认，勿提前抢跑。') }}
        {% elif DL.verdict=='stand_aside' %}{{ t('A stress dislocation with the Fed put ABSENT — the put-absent setup the gate refused from April 2008, where the same capitulation signals kept firing into the fall.', '压力错位且美联储托底缺失 — 这是一道闸自 2008 年 4 月起持续拒绝的「托底缺失」情形，同样的恐慌信号在下跌途中不断触发。') }}
        {% elif _put_unknown %}{{ t('A stress dislocation is live, but the Fed-put switch cannot be read, so the gate refuses to rule. A leg it cannot read is NOT a leg that is quiet — treating it as quiet is what would push this toward the permissive call.', '压力错位正在发生，但美联储托底开关无法判读，因此一道闸拒绝作出判定。读不到的一条腿并不等于安静的一条腿 —— 若当作安静处理，正会把判定推向宽松的一侧。') }}
        {% else %}{{ t('An acute stress dislocation is firing.', '急性压力错位正在触发。') }}{% endif %}
      </p>
      {# POLICY DIVERGENCE — engine-attached context (never changes the verdict): the
         breakeven leg can pass on a day the Fed's own stance reads hawkish. Bilingual
         pair comes from the payload; absent on older payloads, so this stays dark. #}
      {% if DL.policy_divergence is defined and DL.policy_divergence %}
      {% set PD = DL.policy_divergence %}
      <p class="dlx-para dlx-pdiv">⚠ <b>{{ t('Policy divergence', '政策背离') }}</b>{{ t(' — the Fed’s own stance on this same data reads ', ' — 同一份数据中美联储自身立场为') }}<b><span class="l-en">{{ PD.stance }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ PD.stance_zh or PD.stance }}</span></b>.
        <span class="l-en">{{ PD.note }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ PD.note_zh or PD.note }}</span></p>
      {% endif %}
      {# The retired line claimed "the edge is in refusing the knife". A declustered
         replay refuses 2008 and MISSES twice in 2022 plus early 2000 — so the claim
         below is the one engine/dislocation.py EVIDENCE["caveat"] now makes. #}
      <p class="dlx-para muted">{{ t('Known misses: the gate refused the 2008 crash from April 2008, but it printed buyable early in the 2000-02 bear and twice in 2022, both 2022 prints within 0.02pp of this cutoff. A drawdown filter with known misses, not a knife-proof shield — judged on drawdown, not return.', '已知漏判：一道闸自 2008 年 4 月起拒绝了 2008 年崩盘，但在 2000-02 熊市早期给出过「可买入」，2022 年内亦有两次，且这两次距上述阈值均在 0.02 个百分点以内。这是一个存在已知漏判的回撤过滤器，而非防飞刀的护盾 — 以回撤而非回报衡量。') }}</p>
      <div class="dlx-mrow">
        <span class="dlx-mk">{{ t('Measured (SPY 1997-2026)', '实测（标普 1997-2026）') }}</span>
        <span class="dlx-mv muted">{{ t('put-present washouts had ~4pp shallower median 3-month drawdown than put-absent (95% CI [+0.3, +6.3]) — the one effect whose CI excludes zero. The larger hit-rate and 1-year-tail gaps point the same way, but their CIs span zero at ~10 effective crises, so they are carried by sign-consistency (leave-one-year-out 26/28, both split-halves), not significance. A drawdown filter, never alpha.', '托底在位的错杀其中位三月回撤比托底缺失浅约 4 个百分点（95% 置信区间 [+0.3, +6.3]）— 唯一置信区间不含零的效应。更大的胜率与一年尾部差异方向一致，但在约 10 个有效危机样本下置信区间跨零，故由符号一致性支撑（留一年法 26/28、两个样本半区），而非统计显著性。这是回撤过滤器，绝非超额收益。') }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </details>
  {% endif %}{# /dislocation_active #}
</div>
{% endif %}

{# =====================================================================
   §6  CURRENCIES & THE DOLLAR
   ===================================================================== #}
{% if fx_context %}
{% set FX = fx_context %}
{% set _dd = FX.get('dollar_desk') %}
{% set _smile_map = {
  'US growth premium': ['Dollar strong — the US is out-earning the world.', '美元走强 — 美国增长领先全球。'],
  'Risk-off haven bid': ['Dollar strong — investors hiding in it.', '美元走强 — 避险资金涌入。'],
  'Global reflation': ['Dollar soft — growth is broadening beyond the US.', '美元走软 — 增长扩散至美国以外。'],
  'US-specific stress': ['Dollar weak while stress rises — a US-specific worry.', '压力上升而美元走弱 — 美国自身问题。'],
  'Neutral': ['Dollar drifting — no clear regime.', '美元方向不明。']
} %}
{% set _smile_regime = FX.get('smile_regime') %}

<div class="panel span12 rail-fx anim-d5" id="currencies">
  <h2>{{ t('Currencies & the dollar', '货币与美元') }}</h2>

  {# Triple-red banner #}
  {% if _dd and _dd.get('triple_red') %}
  <div class="triple-red-banner">
    <span class="l-en">⚠ Dollar, stocks and bonds are falling together — the dollar is not acting as a safe haven right now.</span>
    <span class="l-zh">⚠ 美元、股票与债券同跌 — 美元当前未起到避险作用。</span>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {# Cross-asset FX caution flags (from cross_asset.caution_flags, owner=='fx') #}
  {% if cross_asset and cross_asset.caution_flags %}
  {% set _fx_flags = cross_asset.caution_flags | selectattr('owner', 'equalto', 'fx') | list %}
  {% if _fx_flags %}
  <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
    {% for f in _fx_flags %}
    <div class="chip {{ 'chip-neg' if f.severity == 'high' else 'chip-warn' }}" style="font-size:12px;padding:4px 10px;display:inline-block;margin:2px 4px 2px 0">
      <span class="l-en">{{ f.en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ f.zh }}</span>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  {% endif %}

  <div class="grid">

    {# Dollar regime card #}
    {% if _dd %}
    <div class="sub span6">
      <h3>{{ t('Dollar regime', '美元周期') }}
        {{ help(
          'Desk legs — real yield z: ' ~ (('%+.2f'|format(_dd.real_rate_z)) if _dd.get('real_rate_z') is not none else '—')
          ~ ' · Fed path: ' ~ ((('%+d'|format(_dd.fed_path_bps|int)) ~ 'bp to 12m') if _dd.get('fed_path_bps') is not none else '—')
          ~ ' · REER gap: ' ~ ((('%+.1f'|format(_dd.usd_reer_gap_pct)) ~ '%') if _dd.get('usd_reer_gap_pct') is not none else '—')
          ~ ' · COT pctile: ' ~ ((_dd.usd_pos_pctile|round|int|string) if _dd.get('usd_pos_pctile') is not none else '—')
          ~ ' · trend legs up: ' ~ ((_dd.trend_n_up|string ~ '/4') if _dd.get('trend_n_up') is not none else '—')
          ~ ' · liquidity: ' ~ (_dd.get('liquidity_dir') or '—')
          ~ ' · smile confirmation: ' ~ (_dd.get('smile_confidence') or '—'),
          '操盘台分项 — 实际利率z: ' ~ (('%+.2f'|format(_dd.real_rate_z)) if _dd.get('real_rate_z') is not none else '—')
          ~ ' · 美联储路径: ' ~ ((('%+d'|format(_dd.fed_path_bps|int)) ~ 'bp/12月') if _dd.get('fed_path_bps') is not none else '—')
          ~ ' · REER缺口: ' ~ ((('%+.1f'|format(_dd.usd_reer_gap_pct)) ~ '%') if _dd.get('usd_reer_gap_pct') is not none else '—')
          ~ ' · COT百分位: ' ~ ((_dd.usd_pos_pctile|round|int|string) if _dd.get('usd_pos_pctile') is not none else '—')
          ~ ' · 趋势上行: ' ~ ((_dd.trend_n_up|string ~ '/4') if _dd.get('trend_n_up') is not none else '—')
          ~ ' · 流动性: ' ~ (_dd.get('liquidity_dir') or '—')
          ~ ' · 微笑确认: ' ~ (_dd.get('smile_confidence') or '—')
        ) }}
      </h3>
      {% if _smile_regime %}
      {% set _smile_words = _smile_map.get(_smile_regime, [_smile_regime, _smile_regime]) %}
      <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">
        <span class="l-en">{{ _smile_words[0] }}</span>
        <span class="l-zh">{{ _smile_words[1] }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {# Lean row #}
      {% if _dd.get('lean') %}
      <div class="muted sm" style="margin-bottom:6px">
        {{ t('Desk read: ', '操盘台读数：') }}
        <b>{{ td(_dd.lean) }}</b>
        {% if _dd.get('lean_n') is not none %}· {{ t('based on ', '基于') }}{{ _dd.lean_n }}{{ t(' desk reads', '项读数') }}{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {# Days held chip #}
      {% set _sc = FX.get('state_changes') %}
      {% if _sc and _sc.get('smile_regime') and _sc.smile_regime.get('days_in_state') is not none %}
      <span class="chip">{{ t('held ','已持续') }}{{ _sc.smile_regime.days_in_state }}{{ t(' days','天') }}</span>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {# Strength meter #}
    {% set _str = FX.get('strength') %}
    {% if _str %}
    {% set _horizon = _str.get('default', '1m') %}
    {% set _pairs = _str.get('horizons', {}).get(_horizon, []) %}
    {% if _pairs %}
    <div class="sub span6">
      <h3>{{ t('Strength vs dollar', '兑美元强弱') }} <span class="muted sm">{{ {'1w':'1-week','1m':'1-month','3m':'3-month'}.get(_horizon, _horizon) }}</span></h3>
      {% for p in _pairs[:8] %}
      {% set _sv = p.get('strength', 0) or 0 %}
      {% set _bar_pct = ([_sv|abs * 50, 50]|min) %}
      <div class="str-bar-row">
        <span class="str-ccy {{ 'str-em' if p.get('em') else '' }}">{{ p.ccy }}</span>
        <div class="str-bar-track">
          {% if _sv >= 0 %}
          <div class="str-bar-fill pos-fill" style="width:{{ _bar_pct }}%"></div>
          {% else %}
          <div class="str-bar-fill neg-fill" style="width:{{ _bar_pct }}%"></div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="str-bar-center"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="str-val {{ 'pos' if _sv > 0 else ('neg' if _sv < 0 else 'muted') }}">{% if p.ccy == 'USD' %}—{% elif p.get('vs_usd_pct') is not none %}{{ '%+.1f'|format(p.vs_usd_pct) }}%{% else %}—{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
      <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:6px">{{ t('% move vs the dollar. Trailing move, not a forecast.','兑美元%变动。仅为近端走势，非预测。') }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% endif %}

    {# Stress radar chips #}
    {% set _rr = FX.get('regime_radar') %}
    {% if _rr %}
    {% set _scenarios = _rr.get('scenarios', []) %}
    {% set _active_scens = [] %}
    {% for s in _scenarios if s is mapping and ((s.get('intensity') or 0) >= 5 or s.get('active')) %}{% set _ = _active_scens.append(s) %}{% endfor %}
    <div class="sub span12">
      <h3>{{ t('Stress patterns', '压力形态') }}</h3>
      {% if _active_scens %}
      {% set _dominant_key = _rr.get('dominant') %}
      {% for sc in _active_scens %}
      {% set _is_dom = _dominant_key and sc.get('key') == _dominant_key %}
      <span class="stress-chip {{ 'active-chip' if sc.get('active') else '' }} {{ 'dominant-chip' if _is_dom else '' }}">
        {% if sc.get('active') %}<span class="pulse-dot"></span>{% endif %}
        <span class="l-en">{{ sc.get('name_en', '') }}</span>
        <span class="l-zh">{{ sc.get('name_zh', '') }}</span>
        <span class="muted sm">{{ (sc.get('intensity') or 0)|round|int }}/100</span>
        {% if _is_dom %}<span class="muted sm">— {{ t('dominant','主导') }}</span>{% endif %}
        {% set _prob = sc.get('prob') %}
        {# receipt numbers only when the empirical read is complete (status ok);
           insufficient/unprecedented histories say so instead of crashing on None #}
        {% if _prob and _prob.get('status') == 'ok' and _prob.get('p_cond') is not none and _prob.get('wilson_lo') is not none and _prob.get('wilson_hi') is not none %}
        {% set _prob_en = ' · At this stress level, ' ~ ((_prob.p_cond * 100)|round|int) ~ '% of past cases saw the adverse move (base rate ' ~ (((_prob.base_rate or 0) * 100)|round|int) ~ '%, 95% CI ' ~ ((_prob.wilson_lo * 100)|round|int) ~ '–' ~ ((_prob.wilson_hi * 100)|round|int) ~ '%, n=' ~ (_prob.get('n_raw') or '—')|string ~ ')' %}
        {% set _prob_zh = ' · 同等压力的历史案例中' ~ ((_prob.p_cond * 100)|round|int) ~ '%出现不利走势（基率' ~ (((_prob.base_rate or 0) * 100)|round|int) ~ '%，95%区间' ~ ((_prob.wilson_lo * 100)|round|int) ~ '–' ~ ((_prob.wilson_hi * 100)|round|int) ~ '%，n=' ~ (_prob.get('n_raw') or '—')|string ~ '）' %}
        {% elif _prob %}
        {% set _prob_en = ' · Not enough history at this stress level for a reliable read' %}
        {% set _prob_zh = ' · 此压力水平历史样本不足，无可靠读数' %}
        {% else %}
        {% set _prob_en = '' %}{% set _prob_zh = '' %}
        {% endif %}
        {{ help(
          'Stress intensity ' ~ ((sc.get('intensity') or 0)|round|int) ~ '/100' ~ _prob_en ~ ('. Managed/intervened regime truncates history — illustrative only.' if sc.get('illustrative') else ''),
          '压力强度 ' ~ ((sc.get('intensity') or 0)|round|int) ~ '/100' ~ _prob_zh ~ ('。受管理/干预体制截断历史 — 仅供示意。' if sc.get('illustrative') else '')
        ) }}
      </span>
      {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
      <div class="muted sm">
        <span class="l-en">No known stress pattern is configured today.</span>
        <span class="l-zh">当前无已知压力形态。</span>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {# CNH row (USDCNH pair) #}
    {% set _pairs_data = FX.get('pairs', {}) %}
    {% if _pairs_data and _pairs_data.get('USDCNH') %}
    {% set _cnh = _pairs_data.USDCNH %}
    {% set _cnh_state = _cnh.get('cnh_basis_state') or 'neutral' %}
    {% set _cnh_map = {
      'neutral': ['Offshore yuan: no unusual pressure', '离岸人民币：无异常压力'],
      'outflow_stress': ['Offshore yuan under outflow pressure', '离岸人民币承受外流压力'],
      'inflow': ['Offshore yuan: inflow bid', '离岸人民币：资金流入']
    } %}
    {# unknown states fall back to the neutral wording — raw enums never render #}
    {% set _cnh_words = _cnh_map.get(_cnh_state, _cnh_map['neutral']) %}
    <div class="sub span6">
      <h3>{{ t('Offshore yuan (CNH)', '离岸人民币 (CNH)') }}</h3>
      <div style="font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600">
        <span class="l-en">{{ _cnh_words[0] }}</span>
        <span class="l-zh">{{ _cnh_words[1] }}</span>
      </div>
      {% if _cnh.get('cnh_basis_bps') is not none %}
      {{ help('CNH basis: ' ~ ('%.0f'|format(_cnh.cnh_basis_bps)) ~ 'bp', 'CNH基差: ' ~ ('%.0f'|format(_cnh.cnh_basis_bps)) ~ 'bp') }}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {# Transmission chips #}
    {% set _tx = FX.get('transmission') %}
    {% if _tx and (_tx.get('headwind_for') or _tx.get('tailwind_for')) %}
    <div class="sub span6">
      <h3>{{ t('Dollar transmission', '美元传导') }}</h3>
      {% if _tx.get('headwind_for') %}
      <div class="muted sm" style="margin-bottom:4px">{{ t('A stronger dollar is pressing on:','美元走强正压制：') }}</div>
      {% for h in _tx.headwind_for %}
      <span class="chip chip-neg">{{ t(h, h) }}</span>
      {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
      {% if _tx.get('tailwind_for') %}
      <div class="muted sm" style="margin:6px 0 4px">{{ t('Helping:','助力：') }}</div>
      {% for h in _tx.tailwind_for %}
      <span class="chip chip-pos">{{ t(h, h) }}</span>
      {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
      {% if _tx.get('corr') %}
      {% set _corr_bits = [] %}
      {% for k, v in _tx.corr.items() %}{% set _ = _corr_bits.append(k ~ ' ' ~ ('%+.2f'|format(v))) %}{% endfor %}
      {{ help('Correlation to the broad dollar: ' ~ _corr_bits|join(' · '), '与广义美元的相关性: ' ~ _corr_bits|join(' · ')) }}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {# What changed strip #}
    {% set _events = FX.get('recent_events', []) %}
    {% if _events %}
    <div class="sub span12">
      <h3>{{ t('What changed', '近期变化') }}</h3>
      {% for ev in _events %}
      {% set _sev = ev.get('severity', 'low') %}
      <div class="what-changed-row">
        <span class="sev-dot {{ 'sev-high' if _sev == 'high' else ('sev-med' if _sev == 'medium' else 'sev-low') }}"></span>
        <span class="muted sm" style="flex:0 0 84px;white-space:nowrap">{{ ev.get('date','') }}</span>
        <span>
          <span class="l-en">{{ ev.get('headline', '') }}</span>
          <span class="l-zh">{{ ev.get('headline_zh', ev.get('headline', '')) }}</span>
        </span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

  </div>{# /grid inside fx section #}

  <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:12.5px">
    <a href="forex.html">{{ t('Full currency board → forex.html','完整货币面板 → forex.html') }}</a>
  </div>
</div>
{% endif %}{# /fx_context #}

</div>{# /outer grid #}

<p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin:16px 0 4px">
  <a href="macro.html">← {{ t('Back to Macro Dashboard','返回宏观仪表盘') }}</a>
  &nbsp;·&nbsp;
  <a href="macro_context.html">{{ t('Macro Weather (labels & history) →','宏观气象台（标签与历史）→') }}</a>
</p>

</div>{# /msx-wrap #}

{# Animate needles to final positions after DOM ready #}
<script>
(function(){
  // Sweep each needle from rest (−90°) to its server-rendered final angle.
  // Server HTML already carries the final rotation, so no-JS renders correctly;
  // here we rewind without transition, force a reflow, then let CSS animate.
  var reduced = false;
  try { reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches; } catch(e){}
  function setNeedle(id, rot){
    var el = document.getElementById(id);
    if(!el) return;
    if(reduced){ el.style.transform = 'rotate(' + rot + 'deg)'; return; }
    var t = el.style.transition;
    el.style.transition = 'none';
    el.style.transform = 'rotate(-90deg)';
    void el.getBoundingClientRect();          // commit the rewind
    el.style.transition = t || 'transform .8s cubic-bezier(.22,.9,.3,1)';
    el.style.transform = 'rotate(' + rot + 'deg)';
  }
  function init(){
    {% if latest and latest.growth_score is not none %}
    setNeedle('gneedle-growth', {{ (((latest.growth_score + 1) / 2 * 100) * 1.8 - 90)|round(1) }});
    {% endif %}
    {% if latest and latest.inflation_score is not none %}
    setNeedle('gneedle-inflation', {{ (((latest.inflation_score + 1) / 2 * 100) * 1.8 - 90)|round(1) }});
    {% endif %}
    {% if fear_greed and fear_greed.dial is not none %}
    setNeedle('gneedle-fg', {{ (fear_greed.dial * 1.8 - 90)|round(1) }});
    {% endif %}
    {% if vix and vix.pctile is not none %}
    setNeedle('gneedle-vix', {{ (vix.pctile * 1.8 - 90)|round(1) }});
    {% endif %}
  }
  if(document.readyState === 'loading'){
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);
  } else {
    init();
  }
})();
</script>
<script src="theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
